 color of her gems on the fly. Even when the board isn\u2019t in her favor, she can recover from tight situations and keep the combos flowing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Phannie</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2656490/extras/7c9848af88bbe57ef8c11235cf7d9456.avif?t=1764130142\" width=800 height=600 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hedonistic gambler.<br>Uses a gun for his flashy and bold fighting style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He can spend AP to split double gems.<br>Increasing his total gems synergizes perfectly with skills that trigger multiple times!<br>With a high-risk high-reward approach, he can unleash massive combos that no other character could!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Beni</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2656490/extras/77201b35423146c2c97c72423fb6aaee.avif?t=1764130142\" width=800 height=600 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A martial artist who fights for the pride of her people. <br>She's a self-proclaimed hero!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She can use AP to consume gems in exchange for Shield, healing, Attack buffs, and more.<br>Her fighting style involves packing a lot into a single hit, and she can stack buffs to accomplish that or to give herself ironclad defense.<br>Swearing to punish evil, she uses her overwhelming power to pursue justice!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2656490/extras/6420c314e863d962f19d9d0077563610.avif?t=1764130142\" width=800 height=135 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" 